  "description": {
   "en": "Just before the summer vacation, Ootsuki was planning to invite Shikiji-san, the girl he had a crush on, to the fireworks festival. However, Shikiji-san invited Ootsuki's best friend, Taiyou, to the fireworks festival first. Ootsuki, who was at a loss for what to do after his broken heart, ends up bumping into Shikiji-san and switching bodies with her! How will this tangled love triangle turn out!?\n\nWon a Semi-outstanding Newcomer Award in the 83rd Chiba Tetsuya Awards (second half of 2020). \n___\n**Alt Official Raws:** [YanMaga Web](https://yanmaga.jp/viewer/comics/%E3%81%A1%E3%81%B0%E3%81%A6%E3%81%A4%E3%82%84%E8%B3%9E%E5%8F%97%E8%B3%9E%E4%BD%9C%E5%93%81%E7%AC%AC79%E5%9B%9E%E7%AC%AC87%E5%9B%9E/1b32228bbef2273473060266104e2b57?cid=06Z0000000000199FREE), [X](https://x.com/yanmaga_new/status/1646695079892127745)"
